get.description:
Progress only - the cheap read to POLL.

The full detail read returns every question and grows with the document;
this one answers "is it done yet" without transferring it.

Reviewed meetings flagged for a manager's attention. MANAGER ONLY.

Requires `meetings:see_all` or a privileged org role on the key's minter;
otherwise 403, because it surfaces every rep's scores.

What this operator has found and classified, right now.

The output of unattended work. Findings are what a `DETECT` dial produces;
a `PROPOSE` dial turns some of them into approval tasks a person decides.

post.description:
Find people at the list's companies. CHARGES per company searched.

`all_rows` searches every company on the list; `first_10` is a cheap trial;
`selected` searches only `record_ids`.

get.description:
The content idea pool mined from the org's own conversations. FREE.

Each idea's evidence is at `GET /content/calendar/ideas/{idea_id}/evidence`;
`POST .../create-content` turns one into a draft.

Return the full booking detail (attendees, references, meeting_url,
responses, internal notes). Backed by ``BookingsHandler.handle_get``;
raises 404 when the UID isn't visible to the caller.

post.description:
Check the stored SugarCRM connection still works, and as whom.

Reads only. `valid: false` means SugarCRM refused the stored credentials;
404 means there is no SugarCRM connection.

get.description:
SPENDS NOTHING. graph8's templates and this organisation's saved ones;
instantiate one with `POST /voice/agents/clone`. A GET here: voice's POST
carries only filters.

SocialPostUpdateRequest.description:
Edit a post. Only the fields you send change.

`account_ref: null` sent EXPLICITLY detaches the draft from its account;
omitting the field leaves the account alone.
